# ============================================================
# Media — zu gross für Git (1 GB Repo-Limit!)
# ============================================================
# Patricia's Shootingbilder (~500 MB)
context/Shootingbilder/*.jpg
context/Shootingbilder/*.jpeg
context/Shootingbilder/*.png

# Kurs-Videos + Kurs-Images (Gigabytes)
